    <briefdescription>
<para>A wrapper for an array of <ref refid="class_m2_1_1_simple_a_ring_1_1_element_array_a35dbdde5f1988748fa6a7fb69fbda477_1a35dbdde5f1988748fa6a7fb69fbda477" kindref="member">ElementType</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is intended to replace dynamically allocated arrays of <ref refid="class_m2_1_1_simple_a_ring_1_1_element_array_a35dbdde5f1988748fa6a7fb69fbda477_1a35dbdde5f1988748fa6a7fb69fbda477" kindref="member">ElementType</ref>. In particular, this will correctly clear the data from the ring upon destruction </para>
    </detaileddescription>
